  "details": "So since the new update with the trust factor system (that works nice) the desktop crawl and crouch looks really dumb. I dont know if this is intended but as far as i know its a problem fron your guys side. Ive reached out to several avatar creators and there is nothing they can do. To give a better picture. When im in desktop and crouch or crawl.. i look like i hold and invisible box or is trying to hug people. It really looks dumb. Before the update i looked chill. In crouch my hands would be on my knees and my upper legs didnt look huge as hell. And in crawl i actually used the arms to crawl with too.. (I can provide pictures of this when i get to pc)\n\nEDIT:\nFound out running and walking animation is the really old default for vrchat. I never used to look like that either. ",
